  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rio+20 2013: GWP - Policy dialogue and knowledge generation for water security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of this project is to expand the involvement of developing countries in the formulation of Post-2015 agenda on water including in the formulation of Sustainable Development Goals on water. The specific purpose is to bring to the table of the Post-2015 processes more research and evidence based knowledge on water security and water resource management and in particular knowledge generated in developing countries. The project will facilitate a number of Policy Dialogues in 22 countries, supported by a Technical Taks Force and a Research Coordination Team. The project will be concluded with a high level presentation at the World Water Forum in April 2015 in Korea.</narrative>
  </description>
